      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "There is no safe \"small dose\" of St. John's Wort when you are taking hormonal birth control, as the mechanism of interaction is about how the herb affects your liver enzymes. Even a small amount can potentially interfere with the effectiveness of your contraceptive pills. For immediate mood support, please consider speaking with a pharmacist who may be able to advise on over-the-counter options that are known to be safer with your current medication. Your healthcare provider remains the best resource for personalized treatment plans.",
